  \(\sigma = \sqrt{\frac{0.15\times0.85}{57}}\), temos que
  \[\begin{aligned}
  P\left(\hat{p}>0.18\right) &= 1 - P\left(\frac{\hat{p}-0.15}{0.0473} < \frac{0.18-0.15}{0.0473}\right) \\
   & = 1 - P\left(Z<0.63\right) = 0.2643.
